      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The author makes a series of personal comments regarding the clinical and instrumental documentation of Kawasaki's disease and its cardiovascular complications. The case in question presented all the characteristic symptoms and cardiovascular complications of Kawasaki's disease and it was possible to diagnose and follow their evolution with the aid of ECG, telecardiogram and echocardiogram. The author underlines the value of clinical symptoms and instrumental data in the diagnosis of Kawasaki's disease."},
